        "id": "condition-1",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Motion sickness (long-standing tendency; symptoms occur with travel)"
        },
        "clinicalStatus": {
          "coding": [
            {
              "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical",
              "code": "active"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Travel-associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports a long-standing tendency to feel unwell during travel, especially in cars and boats. Describes nausea, mild spinning or lightheaded sensation, and cold sweats as a passenger in a car, especially on winding roads. Symptoms have a clear association with motion."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Travel symptom triggers and relief"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Symptoms are worse when reading or using a phone in a moving car, especially while scrolling. They improve when looking at the horizon, sitting in the front passenger seat, or when the car stops."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Symptoms at rest and with positional changes"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no symptoms at rest and no vertigo when rolling over in bed or with quick head turns. Denies true room-spinning sensation at rest."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Vomiting during car travel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports vomiting in a car a couple of times; unsure when, possibly last month or the time before."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Nausea during air travel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports that flights sometimes cause nausea, especially during take-off or landing."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Hearing and ear symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies hearing loss or change, tinnitus, aural fullness, current ear pain, or ear discharge."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurologic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies focal neurologic symptoms, including diplopia, dysarthria, dysphagia, limb weakness, facial droop, weakness, numbness, or paraesthesia. Reports no gait disturbance, blackout episodes, or seizures."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cardiopulmonary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, or syncope."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Headache and visual symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies sudden severe headache and visual loss. Reports a history of 'bad headaches' in high school and briefly mentions intermittent 'bad headaches' with nausea; headache pattern is unclear, and she is unsure whether the earlier headaches were migraines."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Infectious and trauma symptoms or history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no fever, recent upper respiratory infection, sinus symptoms, or recent head trauma."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Gastrointestinal symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports nausea and occasional vomiting only in motion. Denies abdominal pain or altered bowel habit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no anxiety or depression symptoms today."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports variable sleep due to shift work, which she feels is baseline."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Speech and communication during telehealth examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "During the audio-only consultation, patient spoke in full sentences with a strong voice. Speech was fluent with no slurring; affect was appropriate and coherent."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Audible respiratory findings during telehealth examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No audible cough or wheeze; no shortness of breath noted over the phone."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-16",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Symptoms during consultation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient was asymptomatic at rest during the call."
      }
    },
